Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:21.85,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}There's a difference in polarity\N两极性的差异
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.85,0:21:23.28,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Creating friction\N使摩擦产生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.28,0:21:26.23,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Never ever agree\N永远无法达成一致
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.23,0:21:27.94,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}When both of our lights coalesce\N但当你我的光芒融为一体
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:32.21,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}I can feel the stress peel and flake away\N我便能感到紧张在一层层地剥落
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.21,0:21:33.14,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}I'm tasting the air\N我深吸一口气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:38.45,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}It's so fresh cuz I feel at my best with you, today\N空气是如此清新 因为和你在一起我就是最好的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.45,0:21:40.92,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}With you\N因为有你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:43.96,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}So will you stand by my side?\N可以一直陪在我身边吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:46.92,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Can we find symmetry?\N我们之间是否也有相称之处？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:49.86,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}As we collide, futures bind\N彼此的冲突会让未来更加紧密
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.86,0:21:52.93,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Share the same apogee\N我们有着相同的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:58.77,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Always looked but until now I just couldn't see\N我一直在寻觅 但直到现在我才看清
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:22:06.17,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}that arm in arm is where I gotta be\N与你携手同行才是属于我的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.17,0:22:13.18,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Scattered seeds of melodies are bound up in the days\N散落的旋律的种子 埋藏在时光之中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:16.65,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Awaiting just to be found\N只待被发现
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.65,0:22:17.68,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}The day that we met,\N我们相遇的那一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.68,0:22:19.54,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}I confess was too weird for me\N老实说真的很不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.54,0:22:22.46,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Same for you, I'm sure\N我敢肯定你也有同样的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.46,0:22:24.19,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}And now we connect, share the tie如\N今我们一体同心 羁绊相连
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.19,0:22:31.23,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}We see eye to eye cuz all that we have been through\N跨过一路经历的种种 我们心意相通
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.23,0:22:34.28,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}So will you stand by my side?\N可以一直陪在我身边吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:37.27,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Can we find symmetry?\N我们之间是否也有相称之处？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.27,0:22:40.16,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}As we collide, futures bind\N彼此的冲突会让未来更加紧密
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.16,0:22:43.30,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Share the same apogee\N我们有着相同的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:49.14,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}Always looked but until now I just couldn't see\N我一直在寻觅 但直到现在我才看清
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.14,0:22:54.91,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fad(300,300)}that arm in arm is where I gotta be\N与你携手同行才是属于我的归宿
